{"id":"e6357334ccd3589d","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-ntm.md","title":"Nondeterministic Turing Machine","display":"df-ntm — Nondeterministic Turing Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-ntm","aliases":["28-df-ntm"],"display":"df-ntm — Nondeterministic Turing Machine","type":"definition","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-ntm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-ntm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ntm — Nondeterministic Turing Machine"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\">\\(N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\)</span> 是有限描述的候选机器；采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a> 的只读二进制输入带、固定有限条半无限工作带和端标记约定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span> 是工作带数，输入带编号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>；移动量允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-1,0,1\">\\(-1,0,1\\)</span>，端点的处理同确定型机。</li>\n<li>下文用谓词刻画机器集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NTM}\">\\(\\mathrm{NTM}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\Bigl(\nQ,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\land\\Sigma\\cup\\{2,3,4\\}\\subseteq\\Gamma\n\\land|\\Gamma|&lt;\\aleph_0\n\\land q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\in Q\n\\land|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}|=3\n\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^{k+1}\n\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^{k+1})\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\Bigl(\nQ,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\land\\Sigma\\cup\\{2,3,4\\}\\subseteq\\Gamma\n\\land|\\Gamma|&lt;\\aleph_0\n\\land q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\in Q\n\\land|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}|=3\n\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^{k+1}\n\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^{k+1})\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里使用有限非空后继集；无合法动作的情况可转到拒绝状态。原书使用两个转移函数，任意固定有限分支可由固定数量二进制选择模拟。所有分支上的资源取最坏值，接受性取至少一条接受分支。</p>\n<p>来源核对：§2.1.2；印刷41–42页；PDF67–68页。已核对模型说明及定义2.5。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})$ 是有限描述的候选机器；采用 [[28-df-tm]] 的只读二进制输入带、固定有限条半无限工作带和端标记约定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"-1,0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NTM}","display":false},{"tex":"N\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\Bigl(\nQ,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land0<|Q|<\\aleph_0\\land\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\land\\Sigma\\cup\\{2,3,4\\}\\subseteq\\Gamma\n\\land|\\Gamma|<\\aleph_0\n\\land q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\in Q\n\\land|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}|=3\n\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^{k+1}\n\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^{k+1})\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\n\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1590,"backlinks":[{"id":"9efd20f439611336","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6b648ff230619ba2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"599727eea07e91d7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}$，工作带数 $k=k_M$，see [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-ntm]]。\n$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$，有限输入字串写成 $x=x_0\\cdots x_{|x|-1}$；$T=(T_0,\\ldots,T_k)$，$\\boldsymbol i=(i_0,\\ldots,i_k)$。$I_x$ 为只读输入内容，$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)$ 为固定输入的配置集。"},{"id":"343af549f6fb6f36","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；固定有限转移表编码 $\\eta:\\mathrm{NTM}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*$，有效码可在码长多项式时间识别并解码；$\\mathrm{NTM},\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x),\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)$ 见 [[28-df-ntm]]、[[28-df-computation]]。"},{"id":"54da139362531e67","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7514d356710d2e51","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NTM}$、$L(N)$ 与 $\\operatorname{time}_N(x)\\in\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}$ 分别见 [[28-df-ntm]]、[[28-df-computation]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]；时间是所有计算前缀步数的上确界。"},{"id":"3e7207510b515565","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"语言与停机语义：[[28-df-language]]、[[28-df-decider]]、[[28-df-recognizer]]、[[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-ntm]]、[[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]、[[28-df-configuration-graph]]、[[28-df-computation]]。"}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9"]}